[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Eitri
Comment=Your Neovim, with a bunch of agents, terminals and web pages, in a tiling “window” manager.
Comment[zh_CN]=你的 Neovim，加上一堆 agent、终端和网页，放进一个平铺式“窗口”管理器。
Exec=/usr/bin/eitri --quiet %f
Icon=cn.huntergrey.eitri
StartupWMClass=cn.huntergrey.eitri
Terminal=false
Categories=Development;TextEditor;
MimeType=inode/directory;
StartupNotify=true
